# Bible and hymn data stay byte-for-byte the same on every checkout, Windows
# included: the server (includes/offline.php) and the Android app
# (App Files/app/build.gradle.kts) compare their md5 to know the copy inside
# the app is current. A CRLF conversion would make them differ.
